Package: gtk4-layer-shell
Version: @DEB_GTK4-LAYER-SHELL_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/wmww/gtk4-layer-shell
Depends: libgtk-4-1, libwayland0, libglib2.0-0
Description: Layer Shell Wayland protocol for GTK4
 gtk4-layer-shell lets GTK4 windows use the zwlr_layer_surface_v1 protocol to
 become anchored desktop components (panels, launchers, overviews, backgrounds,
 lock surfaces). Used by the iosc desktop shell for its toolkit-based chrome.
 This package contains the shared library, headers, and pkg-config file.
